  "content": "\n\n#### 此資源包為附魔工具增添了<span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>發光效果</strong>,</span> 強化了原有的附魔光澤，讓它們看起來更加鮮豔奪目、風格獨特。\n\n![Sinnelar - 附魔光效 Minecraft 資源包展示（搭配 Hold My Items 模組）](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/showcases/enchantment-glows-with-hold-my-items-mod.webp)\n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/showcases/enchantment-glows-bow.gif\" alt=\"Minecraft 附魔弓箭矢發光動畫\" width=\"50%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/showcases/enchantment-glows-crossbow.gif\" alt=\"Minecraft 附魔弩箭矢發光動畫\" width=\"50%\">\n<br>\n\n此資源包完全適用於 **<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Vanilla Minecraft 1.21.4 - 26.2</span>**\n\n**附魔工具清單：**\n- 劍\n- 斧頭\n- 鐵鎬\n- 鏟子\n- 鋤頭\n- 長矛\n- 戰錘 3D\n- 弓\n- 弩\n- 釣魚竿\n- 三叉戟 (1.21.4+)\n- 盾牌 (1.21.4+)\n\n**<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">低於 1.21.4 的版本需安裝 CIT Resewn<br></span>**\n\n[**<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/enchantment-glows/ui/b-ct-d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"177\"></span>**](https://modrinth.com/mod/cit-resewn)\n\n**致謝：**\n- 沒錯，它靈感來自&nbsp;<strong>Actions & Stuff\n\n---\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3122\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sinnelar/sinnelar-assets/heads/main/sinnelar-affiliates/sparked-host-promo-code-2026-minecraft-sinnelar.webp\" alt=\"使用代碼 Sinnelar 享受 25% 折扣的 Sparded Host 2026 優惠 - Minecraft 伺服器主機\" width=\"100%\">\n  </a>\n</div>",
